/*
 * The declaration build.
 *
 * `module` and `moduleResolution` are `NodeNext` here and nowhere else. The rest
 * of the package develops under the repository's `Bundler` resolution, because
 * that is what Vite, Vitest, and Storybook actually run. But `tsc
 * --emitDeclarationOnly` copies each import specifier into the `.d.ts` verbatim,
 * so whatever resolver this file names is the one every consumer inherits.
 *
 * Under `Bundler` an extensionless relative specifier is legal, and 0.1.2
 * shipped fifteen of them in `dist/index.d.ts` plus `../icons` in
 * `dist/components/Badge.d.ts`. Inside a `"type": "module"` package those are
 * sixteen TS2834 errors for anyone on `Node16` or `NodeNext` — which is every
 * consumer repo. They all set `skipLibCheck: true`, so the errors never
 * surfaced; the entire root export silently became `any` instead.
 *
 * `NodeNext` makes that unshippable rather than invisible. The extensions in
 * `src/` are load-bearing, and this setting is what fails the build when one
 * goes missing, at the moment it goes missing, in this repository — instead of
 * two majors downstream with type safety already gone.
 *
 * The `.js` extensions the emitted declarations need are written in the `.ts`
 * sources, where TypeScript maps them back to `.ts`/`.tsx` on the way in.
 * esbuild (tsup) and Vite (Vitest, Storybook) both do the same, so one spelling
 * satisfies every tool.
 *
 * The obvious alternative — drop this file and emit bundled declarations from
 * the `tsup` run with `--dts`, which would have no relative specifiers to get
 * wrong — does not work here. tsup's declaration path is `rollup-plugin-dts`,
 * which is written against the TypeScript 5 compiler API and throws
 * `Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'useCaseSensitiveFileNames')`
 * against the 7.0.2 this package builds with. Taking that route means pinning a
 * second TypeScript solely to emit declarations, which trades a resolution bug
 * for a version-skew bug. Revisit if tsup's dts path catches up to TypeScript 7.
 */
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "declaration": true,
    "emitDeclarationOnly": true,
    "module": "NodeNext",
    "moduleResolution": "NodeNext",
    "noEmit": false,
    "outDir": "dist",
    "rootDir": "src",
    "types": []
  },
  "include": [
    "src/index.ts",
    "src/static.tsx",
    "src/components/**/*.tsx",
    "src/icons.tsx",
    "src/utils.ts"
  ],
  "exclude": ["src/**/*.stories.tsx", "src/**/*.test.tsx", "src/test"]
}
